          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Qoomár Garmoó Hee birna hardáh ar baraá xirfuuwós dinkwa nee malayke sleémeero tidá' hhohho', inós iri iwiit gawaá kitaangós kuduú xirfuú koóm, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "xoordu sleémeero niri dír geeraawósí burumbuuritiyá', giri partliit adór de'eemusmo bee/aangw nee aara ngir partlaatliti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bee/aangw guri qaas bartá dakós oo doó /iyáy, nee aara giri qaas bartá dakós oo doó basáy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Waawutmo mukduú bartá dákw doó /iyáy guri bay, ‹Qwalaasé', kuungaásingá' Baabuúeé' aa tsuúq. Waawuti'iimadá' iimír tlehhmuú yaamuwo taa amohhe'eés as kuungá' aalaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma qoomár án niwa qwariit, kuungá' ina /aymisé'. Qoomár án niwa waxiit, ina wahasé'. Qoomár án tawa dahaaymo, ina dahi'isé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár án tawa /aankwets, ina tsiitisé'. Qoomár niwa tiiq, ina neetleesi eeré'. Nee qoomár tiwa tseék, ina artá eeré'.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Mukdá' hota ganaá' tari ooi, ‹Aáko, ahaá a xaylá kuúng tawa qwarit, uri /aymiisaán? Laqaá tawa waxit uri wahaasaán? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám a xaylá uwa araán tawa dahaaymo, uri dahi'isaán? Laqaá tawa /aankwets uri tsiitisaán? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee a xaylá uwa araán tawa tiq, uri neetleesi awaán, laqaá tawa baraá doó tseegamo, uri artá awaán?› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo iri ooi, ‹Án a kah, umuúqo gaaro ar taa tlehhé' dír oo wák baraá hhaee'eé' kuká' ninakwe, a ngina aníng i tlehhé'.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Aluuwo mukdá' bartá dákw doó basáy i dirií' guri bay, ‹Quutlé' dir'eene, kuungaásingá' taa lu'ús, tlawsé' baraá asltá baloó gwaa'aaká, tidá' taa amohhe'eés as Neetlaangw nee malaykeerós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma qoomár án niwa qwariit, iga /aymisi'iiká. Nee qoomár niwa waxiit, iga wahasi'iiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár tawa dahaaymo, iga dahi'isi'iiká. Nee qoomár tawa /aankwets, iga tsiitisi'iiká. Qoomár niwa tiiq, iga neetleesi eeri'iiká, nee qoomár niwa baraá doó tseegamo, iga artá eeri'iiká.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Mukdá' sleeme iri ooi, ‹Ahaá Aáko, a xaylá atén kuúng uwa araán tawa qwarit, laqaá tawa waxit, laqaá tawa dahaaymo, laqaá tawa /aankwets, laqaá tawa tiq, laqaá tawa baraá doó tseegamo, uri sagadiyusaniiká?› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós iri ooi, ‹Án a kah, umuúqo gaaro ar taa tlehhi'iiká dír oo wák baraá hhaee'eé' kuká' ninakwe, a ngina aníngií tlehhi'iiká.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee kukaáká' niri tlayá', niri dahamaá ayá' baraá sakwasleemár alhhe'eesay wasl. Ala mukdá' hota ganaá' tan dahamaá áy baraá slafíngw alhhe'eesay wásl.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
